<title>USA: Unitech Industries names new CFO.</title>
<headline>Unitech Industries names new CFO.</headline>
<dateline>SCOTTSDALE, Ariz. 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unitech Industries Inc said on Monday it named Tammy Heppard its new chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Heppard had been an audit manager with accounting firm Deloitte &amp; Touche LLP.</p>
<p>On March 5, Unitech and its Unitech Acquisition Corp unit said they emerged from bankruptcy proceedings.</p>
<p>New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
